1
00:00:01,833 --> 00:00:05,125
Teddy! The exam is TOMORROW and I know nothing!

2
00:00:07,750 --> 00:00:10,166
Relax. We have the whole night.

3
00:00:10,458 --> 00:00:11,666
Okay… chapter one.

4
00:00:13,375 --> 00:00:15,250
Why are there so many pages?

5
00:00:15,541 --> 00:00:18,250
Just five minutes on my phone. Then we study.

6
00:00:19,125 --> 00:00:21,541
Five minutes? You said that an hour ago!

7
00:00:25,958 --> 00:00:27,541
Look, a cat playing piano!

8
00:00:30,458 --> 00:00:31,458
So cute!

9
00:00:32,416 --> 00:00:33,583
Wait… what time is it?

10
00:00:33,875 --> 00:00:35,833
Only… four in the morning.

11
00:00:36,166 --> 00:00:37,041
FOUR?!

12
00:00:37,166 --> 00:00:38,791
We read zero pages!

13
00:00:40,250 --> 00:00:41,000
Don't worry.

14
00:00:41,125 --> 00:00:42,708
I have a genius plan!

15
00:00:44,458 --> 00:00:46,208
So what is your plan?

16
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:48,666
I prayed the exam gets cancelled!

17
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:51,333
Teddy… today is Sunday.

18
00:00:52,416 --> 00:00:53,791
No exam!

19
00:00:53,916 --> 00:00:55,000
Time to sleep!
